  "title": "Why AI is more than generative AI",
  "summary": "Understanding that AI is more than just GenAI is critical to implementing effective solutions for your biggest challenges, not just AI for the sake of AI or endless proofs-of-concept across your business. GenAI on its own, without the right foundation and right context, does not deliver tangible outcomes. By getting to a baseline understanding, we can stop talking about AI and fully unlock how it can deliver business outcomes and value.",
